# integrate (live session 3 and the follow-up): bare names, removable
# singularities and their conditions, constants and their variable
integrate W0
integrate x/x
integrate x/x from -1 to 1
integrate (x^2-1)/(x-1) from 0 to 2
integrate x*y/y
integrate x^2/x^3 from 1 to e
integrate 1/x from -1 to 1
integrate 1
integrate 5 wrt t from 0 to 2
integrate W
range exp
